a congressional hearing in 2021.

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:19.033
Look at this.
This is real.

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:22.501
-Today's gig economy sprung out
from the last recession.

00:01:22.501 --> 00:01:24.567
It offers a job
to anyone who wants one.

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:27.100
-I'm sorry. Mr. Emmer?
-Yes?

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.634
-Are you okay?
-I am.

00:01:28.634 --> 00:01:31.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.100
