-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:37.133
"You're upside down, Tom."

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:39.734
Guys, I heard that Republicans
held a closed-door meeting

00:01:39.734 --> 00:01:41.200
