00:01:46.734 --> 00:01:48.834
Yeah, well, anyway, we got
a clip of the white noise.

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:50.567
-Really?
-Yeah. Check this out.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:53.801
-I was raised in a small town
in southern Indiana,

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:56.334
in a big family with a cornfield
in the backyard.

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:57.834
