I can sleep at night.

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:01.534
Yeah.
Yeah, after 21 days,

00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:03.901
Congress still doesn't have
a speaker of the House.

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:05.334
